    },
    {
      "id": "b-116",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "subgraph \"Persistence Layer\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-117",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Neo4j[Neo4j Graph]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-118",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Vector[Vector Store]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-119",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Cache[Redis Cache]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-120",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "end"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-121",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "subgraph \"Sync Layer\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-122",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "State[State Sync]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-123",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Validate[Data Validation]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-124",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Transform[Data Transform]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-125",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "end"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-126",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Runtime Layer --> Sync Layer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-127",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Sync Layer --> Persistence Layer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-128",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-129",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Would you like me to:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-130",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Create a proof-of-concept implementation using these tools?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-131",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Dive deeper into any specific aspect of this architecture?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-132",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Explore how we can integrate this with our existing codebase?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-133",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The combination of LangGraph's workflow management and PydanticAI's type safety would give us a robust foundation for building the autonomous agent system you envision, while keeping the code maintainable and safe."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-134",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-135",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I'll help you implement the LangGraph and PydanticAI-based architecture in the Hono server. First, let's check our current server structure and dependencies."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-136",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Read file: server-hono/package.json"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-137",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ran tool"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-138",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let's start by creating a new directory structure for our agent system. I'll propose the following changes:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-139",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```bash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-140",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "cd server-hono && mkdir -p src/agents src/agents/types src/agents/tools src/agents/memory src/agents/channels src/agents/workflows"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-141",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-142",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```bash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-143",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "cd server-hono && pnpm add langchain langgraph-ts pydantic-core zod @types/pydantic"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-144",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-145",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I apologize for the command failures. Let me try a different approach:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-146",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```bash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-147",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "pnpm add langchain langgraph-ts pydantic-core zod @types/pydantic"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-148",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-149",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I see the issue. Let me modify the dependencies and try again:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-150",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```bash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-151",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "pnpm add zod langchain-ts @langchain/core @langchain/community"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-152",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-153",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```bash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-154",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "pnpm add zod @langchain/core @langchain/community langchain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-155",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-156",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now that we have our dependencies installed, let's create our base agent system structure. I'll start by creating the core agent types:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-157",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-158",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import { z } from 'zod';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-159",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import type { Tool } from '@langchain/core/tools';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-160",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import type { BaseMessage } from '@langchain/core/messages';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-161",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Base schemas for our agent system"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-162",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export const AgentRoleSchema = z.object({"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-163",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "name: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-164",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "description: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-165",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "goals: z.array(z.string()),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-166",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "tools: z.array(z.string()),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-167",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "traits: z.array(z.string()),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-168",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "memory: z.record(z.unknown()).optional(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-169",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "});"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-170",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export const MessageSchema = z.object({"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-171",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-172",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "content: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-173",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "role: z.enum(['user', 'agent', 'system']),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-174",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "sender: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-175",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "timestamp: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-176",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "channelId: z.string().optional(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-177",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "threadId: z.string().optional(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-178",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "metadata: z.record(z.unknown()).optional(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-179",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "});"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-180",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export const ChannelSchema = z.object({"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-181",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-182",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "name: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-183",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "description: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-184",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "members: z.array(z.string()),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-185",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "isPrivate: z.boolean().default(false),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-186",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "metadata: z.record(z.unknown()).optional(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-187",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "});"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-188",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export const ThreadSchema = z.object({"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-189",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-190",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "channelId: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-191",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "title: z.string(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-192",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "status: z.enum(['active', 'archived', 'resolved']),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-193",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "participants: z.array(z.string()),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-194",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "metadata: z.record(z.unknown()).optional(),"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-195",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "});"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-196",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Type definitions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-197",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export type AgentRole = z.infer<typeof AgentRoleSchema>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-198",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export type Message = z.infer<typeof MessageSchema>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-199",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export type Channel = z.infer<typeof ChannelSchema>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-200",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export type Thread = z.infer<typeof ThreadSchema>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-201",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Agent system interfaces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-202",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export interface AgentContext {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-203",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "role: AgentRole;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-204",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "tools: Map<string, Tool>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-205",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "memory: Map<string, unknown>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-206",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "channels: Map<string, Channel>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-207",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "threads: Map<string, Thread>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-208",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-209",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export interface AgentMessage extends BaseMessage {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-210",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-211",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "channelId?: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-212",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "threadId?: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-213",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "metadata?: Record<string, unknown>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-214",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-215",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export interface AgentAction {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-216",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type: 'message' | 'tool' | 'state';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-217",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "payload: unknown;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-218",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "metadata?: Record<string, unknown>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-219",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-220",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export interface AgentState {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-221",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "context: AgentContext;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-222",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "messages: AgentMessage[];"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-223",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "actions: AgentAction[];"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-224",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "metadata: Record<string, unknown>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-225",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-226",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-227",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I apologize for the error. Let me try creating the directory first:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-228",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```bash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-229",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "mkdir -p server-hono/src/agents/types server-hono/src/agents/tools server-hono/src/agents/memory server-hono/src/agents/channels server-hono/src/agents/workflows"
